-> /Users/mf/_PRIVAT_/New-Stuff/myChess/test-results/king-attack-curve.json

'curve cp' is the KING_ATTACK_PENALTY entry for that index, relative to index 0,
read from the ATTACKER's side: positive means the attacking side scores better, which
is the sign the evaluation stores.

Caveat: isolating f by requiring the opponent to have zero attack units does not
control for general activity. A side with nothing bearing on the enemy king tends to
be the less active side overall, so part of what this column shows may be activity
rather than king pressure. Material is held equal; activity is not.
